<title>USA: Integrated Packaging names Verderico CEO.</title>
<headline>Integrated Packaging names Verderico CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Integrated Packaging Assembly Corp said Thursday it named Patrick Verderico, currently executive vice president and chief operating officer, to the posts of chief executive officer and president.</p>
<p>He succeeds Victor Batinovich, who resigned to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>The comany said it has not yet found a successor for the office of chairman, which had also been held by Batinovich.</p>
